==English==
{{was wotd|2013|January|1}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} ''inception-'', stem of {{term|inceptio|inceptiō|lang=la}}, from {{term|inceptus|lang=la}}, Perfect passive participle of {{term|incipio|incipiō|I begin|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-us-inception.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{IPA|/ɪnˈsɛpʃən/}}
* {{rhymes|ɛpʃən}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[creation]] or [[beginning]] of something; the [[establishment]].
#: ''From its '''inception''' the agency has been helping people obtain and properly install car seats for children.''

